Like we kind of are more like central data science resource.

00:49:59.202 --> 00:50:04.082
We're working on projects across anything that the agency covers.

00:50:04.082 --> 00:50:09.442
Yeah, I've done like respiratory and pertussis and other vaccine-preventable diseases and

00:50:09.442 --> 00:50:11.682
like zoonotic disease and then the drug overdose work.

00:50:12.483 --> 00:50:18.643
So, yeah, I kind of get to have a little bit of work in everything and just find wherever

00:50:18.643 --> 00:50:19.442
help is needed.

00:50:20.562 --> 00:50:22.162
To be able to move on to those projects.

00:50:23.843 --> 00:50:28.003
So, yeah, it's a little more on the data science side in Linux, but I don't think I'm in my

